From: Try Omarchy contributors
Subject: [PATCH] virtio-input: add dedicated native scroll devices

Add a gesture-only indirect touchpad and a high-resolution wheel as standard
virtio-input PCI devices. The touchpad exposes two contacts so the guest input
stack owns scrolling and inertia; the wheel exposes Linux high-resolution axes
plus accumulated legacy detents for compatibility.

